1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,020
I felt this most sharply as a creator, the internet says it wants authenticity, right?

2
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:06,300
But the numbers often tell a different story, I spent hours writing essays, poems and videos

3
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:13,300
that came from lived experience, pieces about discipline, relationships, grief, purpose and

4
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:18,500
the uncomfortable parts of growth, sometimes those barely moved and then I would watch

5
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:25,260
a louder, cleaner, more performative version of the same ideas spread everywhere, not because

6
00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:29,700
it was true, because it was easier to consume.

7
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:29,700
There comes a point where every creator has to decide whether they are building a body
